---
description: Python backend conventions
globs: src/backend/**/*.py, tests/**/*.py, evals/**/*.py, scripts/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

- Python 3.12+, type hints everywhere, Pydantic v2 models for every API and LLM schema.
- SQLAlchemy 2.0 typed ORM (`Mapped[...]`). Code must run on SQLite and Postgres.
- Pure functions for scoring and rules; no I/O inside `raw/scoring`.
- LLM calls only via `LLMRouter.complete_json(prompt_id, variables, schema)`.
- Prompts live in `ai/prompts/*.yaml`; bump `version` when the text changes.
- Each new behaviour ships with a pytest. Use `LLM_MODE=offline` in tests.
- Run `ruff check src tests` before committing.
